# This directory is a live HERMES_HOME. Once `hermes serve` runs against it,
# Hermes will create config.yaml, .env (API KEYS/SECRETS), logs/, sessions/,
# memories/, cron/ here. Ignore everything by default; allowlist only the
# hand-authored, committable pieces.
*
!.gitignore
!SOUL.md
!context/
!context/**
!skills/
!skills/**
